<?xml version="1.0"?>
<contentList xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <content contentuid="h0db39e6ag53a1gc981g61d1g2e626ca3bb7c" version="3">Hey, I wasnt sleeping</content>
  <content contentuid="hf3019d4cg2cf9g0276g1e88g35dde2b80c78" version="3">I totally believe you</content>
  <content contentuid="h07304c5bg90c9g2d7ag7032ga2a2b2b63e36" version="3">Right...</content>
  <content contentuid="h4328f3b7ge07cga161g27c1g982b7790a4ce" version="3">No seriously, Im awake!!</content>
  <content contentuid="hb40c2746g9b18gbaadg1216g36f070c0b75d" version="6">Hey, you there...</content>
  <content contentuid="h5a3f6cd2gb606g93d9gac76g6fe0a6688b03" version="6">What do you want?</content>
  <content contentuid="h8ccf0983gf080g8afegf331g3008a1a36c2e" version="6">&lt;b&gt;Go away.&lt;/b&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="hc1f2fbb7g991eg1441ga9eege91a18596c79" version="6">I lost my lute...</content>
  <content contentuid="h58ba8122g74d9g7cfdg3c1bg65257c695a9b" version="4">Go get my lute</content>
  <content contentuid="hf64db892g6b03g5a9cg9125gaafcefd6bfe1" version="4">&lt;b&gt;NO&lt;/b&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h63e276e0gcb33g5e4dg6c78gb31d68c5e5a9" version="4">Ok</content>
  <content contentuid="h7e4ae732g1e76g5d83g64edg34661e0690f5" version="4">Its in that cave over there</content>
  <content contentuid="hdaae1174ga453gc05ega02bgbbd94fcab753" version="2">Sten</content>
  <content contentuid="h86a22930gf467g2106g8900gb57412fd00c1" version="2">A Song For The Ages</content>
  <content contentuid="hcba8ecd2g4b53g55c9g9329gba5bfef510a1" version="4">Search your surroundings for Stens lute</content>
  <content contentuid="h1e649f2eg87a5g81d2g270bg34acec106c7b" version="2">Find the lute for Sten</content>
  <content contentuid="h7884e5fdg073agc734gda73g71b727c3b602" version="2">Return the lute to Sten</content>
  <content contentuid="h74453ec1g590dg0f3aga6bcg9904b29e7d18" version="7">Hey, I wasn't sleeping</content>
  <content contentuid="h35ee0edag55a7g8721geeeag96633524b42e" version="7">Sure, I believe you</content>
  <content contentuid="h1d1f3cb9g8578gf1b8gca38gae3b11f4ecb5" version="7">Right...</content>
  <content contentuid="h488bc316g6ec2g1729g619fgeab514127741" version="7">No seriously, Im awake.</content>
  <content contentuid="hb0922f94gf39fg99feg95ccgbea1bbb6816a" version="1">Raphael</content>
  <content contentuid="h5e7f891fg181eg7f6bg32bdgff46df89294c" version="1">OG Master of the Game Design</content>
  <content contentuid="h67ff9fd9gd10cg580cg0c59g38074007d1e4" version="2">Return the lute to Sten</content>
  <content contentuid="h4e0bd6bcgb3eeg9240g1fa3gd23f43ceedf7" version="1">Lightning Aura Amulet</content>
  <content contentuid="hc3e4ca71g5747g1687g536bge25c4e1cde8c" version="10">Aye, if you're here for a song, I can't play you one. If not, piss off.</content>
  <content contentuid="h1a78bc78g41a0gf7b7g6096gf18833094b62" version="10">Why are you upset?</content>
  <content contentuid="h41a7c53cg3bfdgc4a0gc94bgb0dbf7aa2168" version="10">No need to be rude.</content>
  <content contentuid="h21f32846g0d64g87a1g7ac4g407b6d645f25" version="10">&lt;i&gt;(Piss off)&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h75b5b170gc59eg2cb6gcd03gf742fc0e4742" version="10">Upset?! Well, my lutes been stolen; my dearest Betsy has been ripped from my arms by an ugly, nasty, bugbear.</content>
  <content contentuid="h83f070b7g71bdg98ddg91fbgcc9c2d461455" version="10">He called my music bad and took her from me! That fleabag doesn't know music if it BIT HIM IN THE ARSE!</content>
  <content contentuid="h07465a4fg9f18g9fd0g5b06gacd0cc1349c2" version="10">Well, if you had the day I've HAD? You'd be upset too. Though, you do look and smell quite bad, that appears to be a normal thing for you lot.</content>
  <content contentuid="hf28cab75gd90eg45deg577cg39a37224655f" version="9">Do you need some help?</content>
  <content contentuid="hcdcfa1bcg080ag99deg3e13g6de8fb67c712" version="9">Sucks to be you.</content>
  <content contentuid="h5089d204g2d98g6bb5gfa37g5daf8367a749" version="9"> Hmm, maybe you can assist me. If you confront him with me, he will be so scared that he hands the lute back! HAHA! Full proof plan! I have some treasures from my village that I could give you for your troubles. How does that sound?</content>
  <content contentuid="hc71ff28cg4438gd187g02e4gc5e0d1f07920" version="9">Sure, let's do this!</content>
  <content contentuid="h40c51fc6g0c3cgad80g9f0agcc32597d9e03" version="9">Nevermind. </content>
  <content contentuid="h90dbf435g5a45g3f16gbb63g9ff9270a55c1" version="9">AHAHA! You're one of the good ones, I see! Well then, I last remember seeing him and his band wandering around northwest of the crash site. While we travel, I want to get your thoughts on a potential song I am working on!</content>
  <content contentuid="h774f4dc8g4231gc585gbaa8ge64188e5bf86" version="9">You bastard! You can't get a man's hopes up and then spit and stomp on it. Bug off then. If you actually care, then come back and find me. No good travelers, not good for anything.</content>
</contentList>